{
  "id": "MAT.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 28",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūjūūka kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī sabato, bohayūjīlīīla kwela ū mu lūshikū lo kwandya nyuma, ū Malia Magadalena nū Malia ū ūngī, būja kūshilola ī shigila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla yading'hima nyahīnga nhaale, nguno malaika wa ng'wa Seeba akika kūfuma ng'wigūlū; ūlīpilingitya ī liwe ūligasīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī suso yakwe yalī gītī lūlabi, ī myenda yakwe yalī yape gītī mawe ga mbula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A balang'hani bakogoha no, būyūdetema dūhū, naabo būbiza gītī baacha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika ūbayombya a bakīma benabo alīhaya, “Mutogohage a bing'we, nguno namanile gīkī mulīnkooba Yesu ūyo walī wakomilwe ha nsalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho a henaha wajūūkaga gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla; nzūgi mulole aho walī alaalile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, jagi wangū mukabawīle a bahemba bakwe, gīkī wajūūkaga kūfuma mu bafu; watongaga kūja Galilaya, mukūja mukamonele kwenūko. H'īyo, ū nene namuwīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bīnga wangū wangū a ha shigila, bigwaga ū kogoha, alīyo hangī bayegaga kīngī nasho; būpeela nhambo kūjūbamanya a bahemba bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bajile, bahayimanīla bamanhya nang'hwe ū Yesu; ūbagīsha, “Mulī mhola!” Būng'wegeela, būndima kū mhambala būnamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “Mutogohage jagi mukabawīle a baana bang'wise gīkī nalīja Galilaya, tūkwibonela kwenūko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlomolomo bo balang'hani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baja a bakīma benabo, bamò ba balang'hani ba shigila būja ū mu nzengo, būūkabawīla a bagabīji bataale pyī īyo īkilonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji bataale na a banamhala bikobya pye hangī būgūhoyela, bizunīlīja kūsola hela kaganda kigelile; būbinha a bashilikale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbawīla; “Hayagi gīkī, ‘Twalī twabītīlwa tūlo ī būjikū, biza a bahemba bakwe būng'wiba!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū ūlū gūliigwiwe nū nsugi, tūkūng'huumūja dūhū a bise, tūng'wīnje a bing'we ū mu makoye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana būjanukūla ī hela, bandya kwīta ūmo bakalangīīlīlwa. Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkumūchiwa na a Bayudaya kūshisha nī lelo īyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtūng'wa kwa bahemba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba abo ikūmi n'ūmò bakaja ī Galilaya, būūkashika ū kū lūgūlū ūlo walī wabalagīla ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamona būnamya, alīyo bamò babo bakayūtawa tawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū wei ū Yesu ūbegeela ūbawīla gīkī, “Pyī ū būdūla ūbo būlī ng'wigūlū nū bo mu sī ninhilwe nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a bing'we jagi hose hose ū mu mahanga; ng'ūbahembeka na kūbabatīīja mu lina lya ng'wa Baba, na lya Ng'wana, na lya ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ng'ūbalanga kwīdima pyī īyo naamalile kūmukomeleja, managi gīkī ū nene ng'wenekīlī nalī hamò ning'we pyī ī shikū jose na jose, kūshisha kū būkalīkījo w'ikanza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
